OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'We're spending Christmas rowing
OL,4,Athe Atlantic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair, who play rugby for Claverdon
OL,7,FLions, are due to set off on 12
OL,8,FDecember from La Gomera. They expect to
OL,9,Ftake up to 65 days to finish, raising
OL,10,Fmoney along the way for mental health
OL,11,Fcharity Looseheadz.
OL,13,FNealon said: "We're not trying to make
OL,14,Fout this is heroic, no-one's forcing us
OL,15,Fto do this... [it] is two mates going
OL,16,Fon a heck of an adventure."
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
